  "permisosTexto": "• Read your spreadsheets (Google Sheets — read-only)\n• List Drive files (Google Drive — read-only)\n• Create and modify the app's backup file (Drive — only the app's file)\n\nPitWall Control does not touch any of your files, only the one it creates.",
